# Defense in depth: the Dockerfile only COPYs specific paths today (never a
# blanket `COPY .`), so nothing here is a live leak right now — but that's
# one Dockerfile edit away from changing, and a real secret (a live OpenAI
# key) has sat in apps/api/.env in this exact repo tree during local dev.
# Never rely on "the Dockerfile happens to not copy it" as the only backstop.

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.github/

**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
